    "missing": [],
    "verdict_notes": "The reader treated component ablations of a new architecture as tests of V4. V4 concerns shape (depth, width, heads) at fixed parameter count within a model family, as in Kaplan. Here the rows are the authors' own design choices and own-method vs baseline comparisons, which the rules exclude. The losses are averages over the last 1k training iterations, not stated as held-out. Several ablation arms differ in parameter count (379M, 386M). No uncertainty is reported. Table 1 loss and PPL values are mutually inconsistent."
  },
